001	GEN	001	031	Ala yi a daliseene birin mato, a fanxi han! Kɔɛ yi so, kuye yi yiba, lɔxɔ senninden nan na ra.
001	GEN	002	001	Kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna daxi na kiini e nun e kui seen birin.
