001	GEN	002	023	Adama yi a fala, a naxa, “Iki, ito fataxi n xɔnna nan na. A mɔn fataxi n fatin nin. A xinla falama nɛn ‘ɲaxanla,’ bayo a minixi xɛmɛni nɛn.”
