005	DEU	021	014	Xa a fe raɲaxu xɛmɛn ma, a nɔɛ a beɲinɲɛ nɛn, a siga dɛnaxan na a kɛnɛn. A mi lan sɔnɔn a xa a mati gbetin na, a mɔn mi nɔɛ a findɛ a konyin na sɔnɔn bayo a bata yi a kolon a ɲaxanla ra.
