# BOOK	008	RUT	Ruth	Ruti
008	RUT	001	001	Kitisane yi Isirayila yamanani waxatin naxan yi, kamɛ gbeen yi so yamanani. Nayi, xɛmɛna nde yi keli Bɛtɛlɛmi taani, Yuda yamanani e nun a ɲaxanla nun a dii xɛmɛ firinne, e yi sa dɔxɔ Moyaba yamanani.
008	RUT	001	002	Na xɛmɛn yi xili nɛn Elimɛlɛki. A ɲaxanla fan yi xili nɛn Nowɛmi. A dii xɛmɛ firinne fan xinle nan itoe ra, Malɔn nun Kiliyon. Efarata bɔnsɔnna nan yi e ra, Bɛtɛlɛmi kaane Yuda yamanani. Elimɛlɛki nun a denbayaan yi siga Moyaba yamanani. E yi dɔxi Moyaba yamanani waxatin naxan yi,
008	RUT	001	003	Elimɛlɛki yi faxa. Nowɛmi yi findi kaɲa gilɛn na e nun a dii xɛmɛ firinne yi lu.
008	RUT	001	004	Nowɛmi a dii xɛmɛne yi Moyaba ɲaxanle futu. Ɲaxanla boden yi xili Oropa, boden fan yi xili Ruti. Nba, e yi lu mɛnni han ɲɛɛ fu ɲɔxɔn.
008	RUT	001	005	Na xanbi ra, a dii xɛmɛ firinne, Malɔn nun Kiliyon fan yi faxa. Nowɛmi keden peen yi lu amasɔtɔ a xɛmɛn nun a dii xɛmɛne bata yi faxa.
008	RUT	001	006	Nowɛmi yi a mɛ fa fala a Alatala bata a yamaan baraka Isirayila yamanani. Marigin bata balon so Isirayila kaane yii ki faɲin. Nanara, Nowɛmi yi a yitɔn a keli Moyaba e nun a mamuxune.
008	RUT	001	007	Nowɛmi yi dɔxi dɛnaxan yi a keli mɛnni, a mamuxu firinne biraxi a fɔxɔ ra, e yi kiraan suxu xɛtɛ Yuda yamanani. Koni e kira yi,
008	RUT	001	008	Nowɛmi yi a fala a mamuxune xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xɛtɛ, birin xa siga a nga konni. Alatala xa hinan ɛ fan na alo ɛ bata hinan n tan nun n ma diine ra kii naxan yi naxanye faxaxi.
008	RUT	001	009	Alatala xa xɛmɛ faɲin fi ɛ ma e nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla ɛ banxine kui.” Awa, Nowɛmi yi a ɲungu a mamuxune ma, koni e lu wugɛ e mame a fe ra.
008	RUT	001	010	E yi a fala e mame xa, e naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, en birin xa siga i kon kaane fɛma.”
008	RUT	001	011	Nowɛmi yi a fala a mamuxune xa, a naxa, “N mamuxune, a lan ɛ xa xɛtɛ ɛ konni. Nanfera ɛ waxi a xɔn ma en birin xa siga? Ɛ yengi a ma fa fala a n mɔn nɔɛ dii xɛmɛna nde barɛ nɛn naxanye ɛ futɛ ba?
008	RUT	001	012	Ɛ xɛtɛ ɛ konni amasɔtɔ n tan bata fori xɛmɛ taa ra dɔxɔn ma. Hali n na a fala n naxa n xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ sɔtɛ to kɔɛɛn na, n dii xɛmɛne bari,
008	RUT	001	013	ɛ nɔɛ dɔxɛ han ne yi gbo ba? Ɛn-ɛn, n mamuxune, ɛ a kolon a na mi ligɛ. Alatala bata n tan, Nowɛmi a dunuɲa ragidin xɔdɔxɔ ayi dangu ɛ gbeen na.”
008	RUT	001	014	Nba, Oropa nun Ruti mɔn yi wuga fɔlɔ. Awa, Oropa yi a ɲungu a mame ma, a xɛtɛ a konni, koni Ruti tan mi tin xɛtɛ.
008	RUT	001	015	Nanara, Nowɛmi yi a fala Ruti xa, a naxa, “Ruti, Oropa bata siga a muxune fɛma e nun a gbee alane. I fan xa siga a fɔxɔ ra ɛ konni.”
008	RUT	001	016	Koni Ruti yi Nowɛmi yabi, a naxa, “I nama a fala a n xa xɛtɛ i fɔxɔ ra. N mame, en birin xa siga. I na siga yire yo yi, en birin nan sigama na yi. I dɔxɔ yire yo yi, n fan dɔxɔn na nin. I ya muxune yi findi n ma muxune ra, i ya Ala yi findi n ma Ala ra.
008	RUT	001	017	I na faxa yire yo yi, n fan faxan mɛnna nin, n maluxun mɛnni. Xa sese en tan firinna fata, xa sayaan mi a ra, Alatala a tɔrɔn naxan ɲaxu dangu tɔrɔn birin na, na xa n li.”
008	RUT	001	018	Nba, Nowɛmi to a to a Ruti bata kankan a ma, a fɔ e firinna birin xa siga, Nowɛmi mi fa fala yo ti sɔnɔn.
008	RUT	001	019	E firinna birin yi siga han Bɛtɛlɛmi taani. E soxina, taan birin yi kabɛ e fe ra, ɲaxanle yi lu a falɛ, e naxa, “Nowɛmi nan yati ito ra ba?”
008	RUT	001	020	Nowɛmi yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ nama n xili Nowɛmi, koni ɛ n xili ba ‘Sɔxɔlɛtɔna’ amasɔtɔ Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna bata tɔrɔn nafa n tan ma.
008	RUT	001	021	Nba, n tan Nowɛmi kelima be waxatin naxan yi, se wuyaxi yi n yii nun. Koni Alatala bata n naxɛtɛ be yi sese mi fa n yii sɔnɔn. Nanfera ɛ tan ɲaxanle n xilima a Nowɛmi? Alatala bata yelin n yalagɛ, Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna bata tɔrɔn nafa n ma.”
008	RUT	001	022	Nba, Nowɛmi nun a mamuxun Ruti fa kii nan na ra sa keli Moyaba yamanani fa Bɛtɛlɛmi yi malo xaba waxatini.
008	RUT	002	001	Xɛmɛna nde yi Nowɛmi a xɛmɛn xabilani a xili Boosu. Muxu kɛndɛn nan yi a ra e nun nafulu kanna. E nun Elimɛlɛki yi xabila kedenna nin.
008	RUT	002	002	Lɔxɔna nde, Ruti Moyaba kaan yi a fala a mame Nowɛmi xa, a naxa, “N xa siga malo xɔri yikentundeni. Waxatina nde, muxuna nde tinma nɛn n yi na liga.” Nowɛmi yi a yabi, a naxa, “N mamuxuna, awa siga.”
008	RUT	002	003	Nayi, Ruti yi siga xɛɛna nde ma malo xɔri makentundeni walikɛne fɔxɔ ra. Boosu nan ma xɛɛ yi na ra Elimɛlɛki xabila yi muxuna nde.
008	RUT	002	004	Ndedi ligaxina, Boosu fan yɛtɛɛn yi fa keli Bɛtɛlɛmi yi, a yi a fala walikɛne xa, a naxa, “Alatala xa lu ɛ xɔn.” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Alatala xa i fan baraka.”
008	RUT	002	005	Boosu yi a walikɛ kuntigin maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɲaxalan sungutunna mundun ito ra?”
008	RUT	002	006	Kuntigin yi Boosu yabi, a naxa, “Ɲaxalan xɔɲɛn nan a ra naxan kelixi Moyaba yamanani, a faxi Nowɛmi nan fɔxɔ ra.
008	RUT	002	007	A n maxɔdin nɛn a xa bira n ma walikɛne fɔxɔ ra, alogo a xa e xɔri makentun. A wanla fɔlɔxi nɛn xabu xɔtɔnni, a baxi sigadeni nɛn iki a matabudeni gageni.”
008	RUT	002	008	Awa, Boosu yi siga Ruti fɛma, a naxa, “N xa a fala i xa, i nama fa siga malo xɔri yikentundeni dɛdɛ yi sɔnɔn fɔ n ma xɛɛn ma be. Ɛ nun ɲaxanli itoe xa lu walɛ be.
008	RUT	002	009	Bira walikɛne fɔxɔ ra, e nɛma yire yo xabɛ, i siga e fɔxɔ ra mɛnni. N bata yamarin fi n ma muxune ma a e nama i tɔrɔ. Awa, min xɔnla na i suxu waxati yo yi, i siga, i sa i min walikɛne min seen na.”
008	RUT	002	010	Ruti yi a xinbi sin Boosu bun ma, a yi a yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Nanfera i xaminxi n ma fe ra? Nanfera i hinanxi n tan xɔɲɛn na?”
008	RUT	002	011	Boosu yi Ruti yabi, a naxa, “N bata na feene birin mɛ i naxan nabaxi i mame xa xabu i ya xɛmɛn faxa. N bata a kolon fa fala i bata i nga nun i fafe nun i ya yamanan beɲin, i fa be yi, i fa so n ma muxune yɛ, i mi yi naxanye kolon a fɔlɔni.
008	RUT	002	012	Ruti, i bata naxan liga, Alatala xa i barayi. I yi duba kamalixin sɔtɔ keli Alatala Isirayilaa Ala yii i faxi naxan fɛma i ratanga feen na.”
008	RUT	002	013	Ruti yi Boosu yabi, a naxa, “Mangana, i fan n tan xa, i bata n bɔɲɛn xunbeli fala faɲin na i naxan tixi n xa, amasɔtɔ hali i ya walikɛ keden peena a fisa n tan xa.”
008	RUT	002	014	Awa, dɛge waxatina a lixina, Boosu yi Ruti xili, a naxa, “Fa be, en birin xa fa en dɛge. Buruna nde tongo i yi a sin sabini.” Nba, Ruti nun walikɛne yi sa dɔxɔ e nun Boosu. Boosu mɔn yi donse ganxina nde radangu Ruti ma. Ruti yi a dɛge han a lugo, a donse dɔnxɛn mɔn yi lu a yii.
008	RUT	002	015	Nba, Ruti mɔn sigaxi na malo xɔri makentundeni, Boosu yi yamarin fi a walikɛne ma, a naxa, “Ruti xa a xaba han xidine saxi dɛnaxan yi. Ɛ nama a rayagi fe yo raba.
008	RUT	002	016	Na na dangu, ɛ mɔn xa maala nde ba xidine ra, ɛ yi e rabeɲin bɔxɔn ma, a yi e tongo. Ɛ nama fala yo ti a xili ma.”
008	RUT	002	017	Awa, Ruti yi fɛriɲɛn maala malanɲɛ han ɲinbanna ra. A yi a maala bɔnbɔ, a yi a liga fayida barama xungbeen yɛ firin ɲɔxɔn.
008	RUT	002	018	Ruti yi maali ito tongo, a siga a ra taani. A bata naxan birin malan, a sa na yita a mame ra. Ruti mɔn yi a donse dɔnxɛne so a mame yii.
008	RUT	002	019	Nowɛmi yi Ruti maxɔdin, a naxa, “I sa maala nun donseni itoe birin malanxi minɛn yi? I yi walima nde a xɛɛ ma nun? Muxun naxan yi yengi dɔxi i xɔn ma, Ala xa na kanna baraka!” Awa, Ruti yi a fala a mame Nowɛmi xa, a naxa, “N yi sa walima na xɛmɛn nan ma xɛɛ ma naxan xili Boosu.”
