009	1SA	027	006	Na lɔxɔn yɛtɛni, Akisi yi Sikilaga so a yii. Nanara, han to Sikilaga findixi Yuda mangane gbeen na.
009	1SA	027	007	Dawuda yi lu Filisitine yamanani ɲɛɛ keden kike naanin.
009	1SA	027	008	Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabirane yi yɛngɛn nakeli Gesuri kaane xili ma, e nun Girisi kaane nun Amalɛkine. Amasɔtɔ, ne siyane yi dɔxi na bɔxɔni Suru binni siga han Misiran yi xabu waxati xunkuye.
009	1SA	027	009	Dawuda yi fuma na yamanana nde ma nɛn, ɲaxanla nun xɛmɛna, a mi sese lu a nii ra. A yi yɛxɛɛne nun ɲingene nun sofanle nun ɲɔgɔmɛne nun dugine tongoma, a mɔn yi xɛtɛ Akisi fɛma.
009	1SA	027	010	Akisi yi a maxɔdinma, a naxa, “Ɛ yɛngɛn nakelixi nde xili ma to?” Dawuda yi a yabi, a naxa, “Yuda bɔxɔn yiifari fɔxɔn xili ma” hanma “Yerameeline bɔxɔn yiifari fɔxɔn xili ma,” hanma “Kenine bɔxɔn yiifari fɔxɔn xili ma.”
009	1SA	027	011	Xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla, Dawuda mi yi sese luma a nii ra, naxan nɔɛ fɛ Gati yi, bayo a yi a mirixi, a naxa, “E nɔɛ feene falɛ nxu xili ma nɛn, e a falɛ, ‘Dawuda a liga ikiini.’” A yi a ligama na kii nin a waxatin naxan birin ti Filisitine yamanani.
009	1SA	027	012	Nanara, Akisi yi laxi Dawuda ra han! Bayo a yi a mirixi nɛn, a naxa, “Dawuda bata Isirayila kaane raxɔlɔ han! Nayi, a findima nɛn n ma walikɛɛn na habadan!”
009	1SA	028	001	Na waxatini, Filisitine yi e sofane malan a findi gali kedenna ra siga Isirayila yɛngɛdeni. Akisi yi a fala Dawuda xa, a naxa, “A kolon ki faɲi a ɛ nun i fɔxɔrabirane luma nɛn n ma ganla yɛ.”
009	1SA	028	002	Dawuda yi Akisi yabi, a naxa, “Nayi, i yɛtɛna a toma nɛn i ya walikɛ naxan ligama.” Akisi yi a fala Dawuda xa, a naxa, “Nayi, n na i tongoma nɛn n yɛtɛɛn kantan muxun na n siin birin yi.”
009	1SA	028	003	Samuyɛli bata yi faxa, Isirayila birin bata yi a saya feene liga, e yi a maluxun a taani Rama yi. Sɔli bata yi koron bɔnbɔne nun yiimatone kedi yamanani.
009	1SA	028	004	Filisitine yi e malan e fa kuru Sunami taani. Sɔli yi Isirayila birin malan Gilibowa yi.
009	1SA	028	005	Sɔli Filisitine ganla to waxatin naxan yi, a gaxu, a bɔɲɛn yi mini.
009	1SA	028	006	Sɔli yi Alatala maxɔdin, koni Alatala mi a yabi xiyeni, a mi a yabi saraxaraline masɛnsɛn ti seene yi, a mi a yabi nabine xɔn.
009	1SA	028	007	Sɔli yi a fala a walikɛɛn xa, a naxa, “Ɛ ɲaxanla nde fen n xa naxan falan tima barinne ra, alogo n xa sa a maxɔdin.” A walikɛne yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Na nde sa En-Dɔri.”
009	1SA	028	008	Sɔli yi a maxidi alo muxu gbɛtɛ, a doma gbɛtɛ so. E nun a fɔxɔrabira firin yi so ɲaxanla konni kɔɛɛn na. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N wama nɛn i xa barinna nde maxɔdin n xa. N na naxan mataxamaseri i xa, i na ramini.”
009	1SA	028	009	Koni ɲaxanla yi a yabi, a naxa, “I a kolon ki faɲi Sɔli naxan ligaxi. A bata koron bɔnbɔne nun yiimatone ɲan yamanani. I katama n mayenden feen nan na alogo n fan xa faxa ba?”
009	1SA	028	010	Sɔli yi a kɔlɔ Alatala yi, a naxa, “N bata n kɔlɔ i xa habadan Alatala yi, fefe mi i sɔtɛ feni ito yi.”
009	1SA	028	011	Ɲaxanla yi a fala, a naxa, “I waxi n xa nde yita i ra?” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “Samuyɛli yita n na.”
009	1SA	028	012	Ɲaxanla Samuyɛli to waxatin naxan, a yi gbelegbele, a yi a fala Sɔli xa, a naxa, “Nanfera i n yanfaxi? I tan nan Sɔli ra!”
009	1SA	028	013	Mangan yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I nama gaxu, koni i nanse toma?” Ɲaxanla yi a fala Sɔli xa, a naxa, “N barinna nde nan toma minɛ bɔxɔn bun.”
009	1SA	028	014	A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “A yɛtagin di?” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “Xɛmɛ fonna nan tema a mafilinxi dugini.” Sɔli yi a kolon a Samuyɛli nan yi a ra, a xinbi sin, a yɛtagin yi lan bɔxɔn ma.
009	1SA	028	015	Samuyɛli yi a fala Sɔli xa, a naxa, “Nanfera i n ma matabuni kalaxi n ma? Nanfera i n xilixi, n te?” Sɔli yi a yabi, a naxa, “N tɔrɔxi han! Filisitine n yɛngɛma, Ala bata n nabeɲin. A mi fa n yabima nabi yi, a mi n yabima xiye yi. N na i xilixi na nan ma alogo i xa fa a fala, n lan n xa naxan liga.”
009	1SA	028	016	Samuyɛli yi a fala, a naxa, “Nanfera i n maxɔdinma? Bayo Alatala bata i rabeɲin, a findi i yaxun na.
009	1SA	028	017	Alatala bata n ma falan nakamali i ma. A bata mangayaan ba i yii, a a so Dawuda yii.
009	1SA	028	018	Bayo i mi Alatala xuiin namɛ, i tondi Amalɛkine raxɔrɛ, nanara Alatala ito ligaxi i ra to.
009	1SA	028	019	Alatala i tan nun Isirayila soma nɛn Filisitine yii. Tila, i tan nun i ya dii xɛmɛne fama nɛn be n dɛnaxan yi, Alatala yi Isirayila ganla so Filisitine yii.”
009	1SA	028	020	Sɔli yi bira, a a yibandun bɔxɔni, gaxu gbeen yi a suxu Samuyɛli a falane fe ra. Fangan yi ɲan a yi, bayo a mi yi donse yo donma yanyin nun kɔɛɛn na.
009	1SA	028	021	Ɲaxanla yi fa Sɔli fɛma, a a to fa fala a gaxuxi han! A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “A mato, i ya walikɛɛn bata i xuiin namɛ. Fayida, n na n niin fi nɛn i ya falane suxudeni.
009	1SA	028	022	Iki, i fan xa i tuli mati n na. N xa fa donseen na i xɔn, i yi a don alogo i fangan sɔtɔ benun i xa kiraan suxu.”
009	1SA	028	023	Koni a tondi, a yi a fala, a naxa, “N mi sese donma.” A fɔxɔrabirane nun ɲaxanla yi kankan a ma, a yi e xuiin namɛ. A keli bɔxɔni a dɔxɔ saden ma.
009	1SA	028	024	Ɲaxanla yi ɲinge dii raturaxin faxa mafurɛn naxan yi ramaraxi a yii. A murutu fuɲin tongo, a a bɔnbɔ, a burun gan a rate setareyani.
009	1SA	028	025	A yi ne so Sɔli nun a fɔxɔrabirane yii, e yi e dɛge. E yi keli na kɔɛɛn na, e siga.
009	1SA	029	001	Filisitine yi e ganla birin malan Afeki yi. Isirayila kaane tan yi e malan tigin dɛxɔn Yɛsɛreli yi.
009	1SA	029	002	Filisitine mangane yi e ganla yɛba sofa kɛmɛ kɛmɛ nun sofa wuli wuli yɛɛn ma, siga yɛngɛdeni. Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabirane yi Manga Akisi matima, ne yi sigan ti xanbin na.
009	1SA	029	003	Filisitine kuntigine yi a fala, e naxa, “Nde Heburuni itoe ra?” Akisi yi Filisitine mangane yabi, a naxa, “Dawuda na a ra, Sɔli a kuntigina nde, Isirayila mangana. A n fɛma xabu to mi a ra. N mi fɛ yo toxi a ra sa keli a fa lɔxɔn ma han to.”
009	1SA	029	004	Filisitine kuntigine yi xɔlɔ Akisi ma e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Ɛ xɛmɛni ito raxɛtɛ, a xa xɛtɛ taani i tinxi a xa dɔxɔ dɛnaxan yi. A nama siga en ma yɛngɛni, bayo a nɔɛ maxɛtɛ nɛn en xili ma yɛngɛni. Xɛmɛni ito a kanna diɲan sɔtɔma di, xa a mi en ma sofane xunne so a yii?
009	1SA	029	005	En nama ɲinan a ɲaxanle yi Dawuda ito nan xili sama sigini e bodon waxatin naxan yi, e naxa, ‘Sɔli bata muxu wuli keden faxa, Dawuda tan wuli fu.’”
009	1SA	029	006	Akisi yi Dawuda xili a a fala a xa, a naxa, “N bata n kɔlɔ habadan Alatala yi, xɛmɛ faɲin nan i tan na, a yi rafanɲɛ n ma xa i lu n ma ganla yɛ. Bayo n mi fɛ yo toxi i ra keli i fa lɔxɔn ma han to. Koni i raɲaxu mangane ma.
009	1SA	029	007	Nayi, xɛtɛ i konni bɔɲɛ xunbenli, alogo i nama fefe liga naxan naɲaxu mangane ma.”
009	1SA	029	008	Dawuda yi a fala Akisi xa, a naxa, “Koni n nanse ligaxi? I fɛɛn mundun toxi i ya walikɛɛn na keli n fa lɔxɔn ma han to, alogo n nama siga mangana, n kanna yaxune yɛngɛdeni?”
009	1SA	029	009	Akisi yi Dawuda yabi, a naxa, “N na a kolon, a i rafan n ma alo Alaa malekana, koni Filisitine kuntigine bata a fala iki, a naxa, ‘A nama te nxu fɔxɔ ra yɛngɛni.’
009	1SA	029	010	Keli sinma tila e nun naxanye faxi i fɔxɔ ra. Ɛ siga xɔtɔnni kuye nɛma yiba.”
009	1SA	029	011	Na xɔtɔn bode, Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabirane yi keli sinma alogo e xa xɛtɛ Filisitine yamanani. Filisitine tan yi siga Yɛsɛreli yi.
009	1SA	030	001	Xi saxande lɔxɔni, Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabirane yi sa Sikilaga li. A yi a li Amalɛkine bata yi yɛngɛn nakeli Yuda yiifari fɔxɔni e nun Sikilaga xili ma. E bata yi Sikilaga taan kala, e a gan.
009	1SA	030	002	E bata yi ɲaxanle suxu e nun naxanye birin yi taani, muxudin nun muxu gbeena. E mi muxu yo faxa, koni e bata yi e birin xali, e kiraan suxu.
009	1SA	030	003	Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabirane to Sikilaga taan li, e yi a ganxin to. E ɲaxanle nun e dii xɛmɛne nun e dii tɛmɛne bata yi suxu.
009	1SA	030	004	Nayi, Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabirane birin yi lu wugɛ xui yitexin na han fanga mi lu e ra sɔnɔn e wuga.
009	1SA	030	005	Dawudaa ɲaxalan firinne bata yi xali, Axinowami Yɛsɛreli kaana e nun Abigayili Karemele kaana, Nabali a kaɲa gilɛna.
009	1SA	030	006	Dawuda yi lu sɔxɔlɛni, bayo a fɔxɔrabirane yi a magɔlɔn feen falama. Xɔlɔn yi birin niini, birin ma dii ɲaxanle nun e dii xɛmɛne e fe ra. Koni Dawuda yi fangan sɔtɔ Alatala yi, a Ala.
009	1SA	030	007	Dawuda yi a fala saraxarali Abiyatari xa, Aximeleki a dii xɛmɛna, a naxa, “Fa saraxarali domaan na n xɔn ma. Ala xa maxɔdin.” Abiyatari yi fa a ra.
009	1SA	030	008	Dawuda yi Alatala maxɔdin, a naxa, “N birɛ ganli ito fɔxɔ ra ba? N na a suxɛ ba?” Alatala yi a yabi, a naxa, “Bira a fɔxɔ ra, i e suxuma nɛn yati, i yi muxu suxine xunba.”
009	1SA	030	009	Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabira kɛmɛn sennin yi kiraan suxu. E Besori Baan li waxatin naxan yi, nde yi lu xanbin na mɛnni.
009	1SA	030	010	Bayo muxu kɛmɛ firin yi taganxi naxanye mi yi nɔɛ Besori xudeni gidɛ. Dawuda nun muxu kɛmɛ naaninna yi sagatanna ti.
009	1SA	030	011	E Misiran kaana nde li xɛɛn ma, e a xali Dawuda fɛma. E donseen so a yii e nun igena.
009	1SA	030	012	E yi xɔdɛ xarena nde so a yii e nun ɲaxundan xaren tɔnsɔn firin. A to yelin ne donɲɛ, a xaxili sɔtɔ, bayo a bata yi yanyi saxan kɔɛ saxan ti a mi ige min a mi donse don.
009	1SA	030	013	Dawuda yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I kanna nde ra, i kelixi minɛn yi?” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “Misiran kaan nan n na, Amalɛkina nde a konyina. N kanna bata n furaxin nabeɲin a xii saxanna nan to.
009	1SA	030	014	Nxu bata yi fu Keretine bɔxɔn yiifari fɔxɔn ma, e nun Yuda bɔxɔna, e nun Kalebi bɔxɔn yiifari fɔxɔna. Nxu yi Sikilaga taan gan.”
009	1SA	030	015	Dawuda yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I nɔɛ n xalɛ ganla yireni?” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “I na i kɔlɔ n xa Ala yi a i mi n faxɛ e nun i mi n soɛ n kanna yii, n na e yiren yitɛ i ra nɛn.”
009	1SA	030	016	Nayi, xɛmɛn yi Dawuda xali han Amalɛkine dɛnaxan yi. E yi e li xuyaxi ayi bɔxɔn birin yi, e e dɛgema, e e minma, e ɲaxanxi, na yɛngɛ yi se tongoxine fe ra e naxanye tongo Filisitine nun Yuda yamanani.
009	1SA	030	017	Dawuda yi e yɛngɛ keli subaxan ma han na xɔtɔn bode ɲinbanna, e sese mi a yimini, fɔ banxulan kɛmɛ naaninna naxanye nɔ e giyɛ ɲɔgɔmɛne fari.
009	1SA	030	018	Amalɛkine naxanye birin suxu Dawuda yi ne xɔrɔya, katarabi a ɲaxalan firinne ma.
009	1SA	030	019	Muxu yo mi yi luxi, a xurin nun a xungbena, dii xɛmɛn nun dii tɛmɛna, e nun yii seene, e naxanye birin tongo, na sese mi lu. Dawuda yi fa e birin na.
009	1SA	030	020	A mɔn yi Amalɛkine yɛxɛɛne nun e ɲingene tongo. Naxanye yi na xuruseene xalima ne yi a falama, e naxa, “Dawuda yii se suxine ni i ra.”
009	1SA	030	021	Dawuda yi fa mɛnni xɛmɛ kɛmɛ firinne yi dɛnaxan yi naxanye yi taganxi, e lu xanbin na Besori Baan dɛ. E siga Dawuda nun yamaan nalandeni naxanye yi a fɔxɔ ra. Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabirane yi maso e ra, a yi e xɔntɔn.
009	1SA	030	022	Ɲaxuden nun fuyantenna naxanye yi yamaan yɛ Dawuda fɔxɔ ra, ne yi falan tongo, e naxa, “Bayo e mi faxi en fɔxɔ ra, yɛngɛ yi seen naxanye xunbaxi sese mi yitaxunma e ra. Koni birin ma ɲaxanla nun a diine yi so a yii, e e xali, e siga.”
009	1SA	030	023	Koni Dawuda yi a fala, a naxa, “Ngaxakedenne ɛ nama a liga na kiini Alatala kiseene ra, a naxan fi en ma. Bayo a bata en kantan, a ganla so nxu yii naxan fa en xili ma.
009	1SA	030	024	Nayi, nde ɛ xuiin namɛma feni ito yi? Naxan godoxi yɛngɛni e nun naxan dɔxi goronne dɛxɔn, e birin gbeen yɛlanma nɛn.”
009	1SA	030	025	Na lɔxɔni Dawuda yi na findi sariyan na Isirayila xa. Na sariyan mɔn na han to.
009	1SA	030	026	A to Sikilaga li, Dawuda yi yɛngɛ yi seen fɔxɔ kedenna rasiga Yuda fonne ma, a xɔyine. A falani ito ti e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ gbeen ni i ra, seen naxanye tongoxi Alatala yaxune yii.”
009	1SA	030	027	A a rasiga fonni itoe birin ma: naxanye Betɛli nun Ramoti-Negewi nun Yatiri yi,
009	1SA	030	028	naxanye Aroyeri nun Sifimoti nun Esitemowa yi,
009	1SA	030	029	naxanye Rakali yi e nun Yerameeli taa kaane nun Keni taa kaane,
009	1SA	030	030	naxanye Xoroma nun Bori-Asan nun Ataki yi,
009	1SA	030	031	naxanye Xebiron yi, e nun Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabirane bata yi siga dɛnaxan birin yi.
009	1SA	031	001	Filisitine yi Isirayila yɛngɛ. Isirayila kaane yi e gi, a gbegbe yi faxa Gilibowa geyaan fari.
009	1SA	031	002	Filisitine yi xaɲɛ ayi Sɔli nun a diine xili ma. E yi Sɔli a dii xɛmɛne faxa, Yonatan nun Abinadabo nun Maliki-Suwa.
009	1SA	031	003	Yɛngɛn yi wolon Sɔli rabilinni, xali wonle yi a li, a yi gaxu e yɛɛ ra han!
009	1SA	031	004	Sɔli yi a fala yɛngɛ so se maxanla xa, a naxa, “I ya silanfanna tongo i n faxa, bayo n mi waxi Ala kolontareni itoe xa n masɔxɔn, e yi n tɔrɔ.” Koni a yɛngɛ so se maxanla yi tondi, bayo a yi gaxuxi han! Nayi, Sɔli yi a silanfanna tongo a sɔnsɔn a dɛ.
009	1SA	031	005	Sɔli a yɛngɛ so se maxanla to a to faxaxi, a fan yi sɔnsɔn a silanfanna dɛ e birin yi faxa.
009	1SA	031	006	Sɔli nun a dii xɛmɛ saxanne nun a yɛngɛ so se maxanla nun a fɔxɔrabirane birin yi faxa e bode xɔn lɔxɔ kedenni na kii nin.
009	1SA	031	007	Isirayila kaan naxanye yi lanbanna fɔxɔ kedenni, e nun Yurudɛn baan fɔxɔ boden na, ne yi a to a Isirayila ganla yi a gima. E mɔn yi a to a Sɔli nun a diine bata yi faxa. E yi e taane rabeɲin, e e gi. Filisitine yi fa dɔxɔ na.
009	1SA	031	008	Na xɔtɔn bode, Filisitine yi fa binbine yii seene tongodeni, e yi Sɔli nun a diine binbine to biraxi Gilibowa geyaan fari.
009	1SA	031	009	E Sɔli xunna bolon a dɛ, e a yɛngɛ so seene tongo. E yi na fe xibarun nasiga Filisiti yamanan birin yi e nun e suxure banxine yi e nun e yamaan tagi.
009	1SA	031	010	E yi Sɔli a yɛngɛ so seene sa Asitarate suxure banxin kui, e a binbin singan Beti-San taan yinna xɔn.
009	1SA	031	011	Yabɛsi Galadi kaane to a mɛ Filisitine naxan ligaxi Sɔli ra,
009	1SA	031	012	e banxulan sɛnbɛmane yi keli, e sigan ti kɔɛɛn birin na siga han Beti-San. E Sɔli nun a diine binbine tongo Beti-San yinna kanke. E yi xɛtɛ Yabɛsi yi, e yi e gan mɛnni.
009	1SA	031	013	E yi e xɔnne tongo, e e maluxun tamaro wudi binla bun ma Yabɛsi yi. E yi sunna suxu xii solofere.
