# BOOK	010	2SA	2 Samuel	Samuyɛli Firindena
010	2SA	001	001	Sɔli faxa xanbini, Dawuda Amalɛkine nɔxina, Dawuda yi fa lu Sikilaga taani xi firin.
010	2SA	001	002	Xi saxande lɔxɔni, banxulanna nde yi fa, sa keli Sɔli a gali malandeni. A dugine yibɔxi, burunburunna a xunni sununa fe ra. A to Dawuda fɛman li, a yi a xinbi sin bɔxɔn ma.
010	2SA	001	003	Dawuda yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I kelixi minɛn?” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “N nan n gixi Isirayila ganla nan ma.”
010	2SA	001	004	Dawuda yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “A yɛba n xa naxan danguxi.” Xɛmɛn yi a yabi, a naxa, “Isirayila sofa ganla bata a gi yɛngɛni, sofa wuyaxi bata faxa. Hali, Sɔli nun a diin Yonatan bata faxa.”
010	2SA	001	005	Banxulanna naxan faxi xɛrayaan na, Dawuda mɔn yi na maxɔdin, a naxa, “I a kolonxi di, a Sɔli nun a dii xɛmɛn Yonatan bata faxa?”
010	2SA	001	006	Banxulanna yi a yabi, a naxa, “N yi Gilibowa geyaan nan fari, n yi Sɔli to, a tanban tixi a bun, a yi gbɛtɛnxi yaxune wontorone nun soo ragine xɔn.
010	2SA	001	007	A to a firifiri, a yi n to, a yi n xili. N yi a yabi, n naxa, ‘N tan ni i ra.’
