011	1KI	006	001	Isirayila kaane mini xanbini Misiran yamanani, na ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ naanin ɲɛɛ tonge solomasɛxɛden nan yi a ra, Sulemani yi Alatala Batu Banxin ti fɔlɔ, a mangayaan ɲɛɛ naanindena Isirayila xun na Siwi kiken na, naxan findixi ɲɛɛn kike firinden na.
