013	1CH	006	049	Haruna nun a diine nan yi saraxa gan daxine bama saraxa ganden fari, e mɔn yi wusulanna fan ganma saraxan na wusulan saraxa ganden fari. E yi na wanle birin kɛma yire sariɲanxi fisamantenna nin Ala solona feen na Isirayila kaane xa, alo Alaa walikɛɛn Musa a yamari kii naxan yi.
013	1CH	006	050	Haruna yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Haruna yi Eleyasari sɔtɔ. Eleyasari yi Finexasi sɔtɔ. Finexasi yi Abisuwa sɔtɔ.
