013	1CH	021	013	Dawuda yi Gadi yabi, a naxa, “N bɔɲɛn sunuxi han! A lan n xa n yɛtɛ lu Alatala yii bayo a kininkininna gbo, na fisa benun n xa lu adamadiine sagoni.”
