016	NEH	001	001	Xakaliyaa dii xɛmɛn Neyemi a falane. Kisilewi kiken na, Aratasɛrɛkɛsi a mangayaan ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛdeni, n yi Suse manga taani.
016	NEH	001	002	Ngaxakedenna Xanani nun muxuna ndee yi fa sa keli Yuda yi. N yi e maxɔdin Yahudiyane fe ma, yaxune naxanye suxu, e siga e ra konyiyani, e ɲɛɲɛne mɔn yi xɛtɛ Yerusalɛn yi, e nun lan Yerusalɛn ma fe ma.
016	NEH	001	003	E yi n yabi, e naxa, “Suxu muxun naxanye lu e nii ra, na ndee bata fa dɔxɔ Yuda yamanani, koni e yigitɛgɛxi, e yagixi. Yerusalɛn taan nabilinna yinne yirena ndee bata bira, tɛɛn yi taan so dɛɛne birin gan.”
016	NEH	001	004	N to na falane mɛ, n yi dɔxɔ, n wuga, n yi sunu xi wuyaxi, n yi sun, n yi Ala maxandi, Ala Naxan Kore,
