018	JOB	001	001	Xɛmɛna nde yi Yusu yamanani, a yi xili Yuba. Fɛ mi yi na xɛmɛn na, muxu faɲin nan yi a ra, a yi gaxuxi Ala yɛɛ ra, a yi fe ɲaxin matangama.
