023	ISA	001	018	Alatala naxa, “Ɛ fa, en fa feene fɛsɛfɛsɛ en bode xɔn. Hali ɛ yulubine luxi alo wunla, e fixama nɛn alo balabalan kɛsɛna. Hali e to gbeeli iki, e mɔn sariɲanma nɛn alo dugi fixɛna.
