032	JON	001	012	Awa, Yunusa yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ n tongo, ɛ yi n woli fɔxɔ igeni, nayi igena a raxarama nɛn. N na kolon fa fala foye gbeeni ito ɛ tɔrɔma n tan nan ma fe ra.”
