# BOOK	038	ZEC	Zechariah	Sakari
038	ZEC	001	001	Dariyusi a mangayaan ɲɛɛ firinden kike solomasɛxɛdeni, Alatala yi falan ti Nabi Sakari xa, Bereki a dii xɛmɛna, Yido mamandenna. A naxa:
038	ZEC	001	002	“Alatala xɔlɔ gbeen ti nɛn ɛ benbane xili ma.
038	ZEC	001	003	Koni, i xa a fala e xa fa fala Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna naxa iki: ‘Ɛ mɔn xa fa n ma,’ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘N fan fama nɛn ɛ ma.’ Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna falan nan na ra.
038	ZEC	001	004	Ɛ nama lu alo ɛ benbane, nabi fonne yi ito ralima naxanye ma: Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Ɛ xɛtɛ ɛ fe ɲaxine nun ɛ kɛwali ɲaxine fɔxɔ ra.’ Koni e mi e tuli mati, e mi n xuiin namɛ. Alatalaa falan nan na ra.
038	ZEC	001	005	Ɛ benbane minɛn? Nabine go? E ɲɛɲɛ habadan?
038	ZEC	001	006	Anu, n falane nun sariyan naxanye yamari nabine ma, n ma walikɛne, ne xa mi ɛ benbane li ba? Nayi e yi tubi, e yi a fala, e naxa, ‘Naxan lanxi nxɔ feene nun kɛwanle ma, Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna bata na nan liga nxu ra alo a bata yi a ragidi kii naxan yi.’”
038	ZEC	001	007	Kike fu nun kedenden xii mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanindena, Sebati kikena, Dariyusi a mangayaan ɲɛɛ firindena, Alatala yi falan ti Nabi Sakari xa, Bereki a dii xɛmɛna, Yido mamandenna.
038	ZEC	001	008	N fe toon tixi nɛn kɔɛɛn na alo xiyena. N soo ragina nde nan to soo gbeela fari, a yi tixi miriti wudine tagi darani. Soo gbeele, a gbeeli makatunxine e nun a fixɛne yi a xanbi ra.
038	ZEC	001	009	N yi a maxɔdin, n naxa, “Nanse itoe ra, n kanna?” Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, na yi n yabi, a naxa, “N xa a yita i ra naxan e ra.”
038	ZEC	001	010	Muxun naxan yi tixi miriti wudine tagi, na yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala ne nan xɛxi bɔxɔni sigadeni.”
038	ZEC	001	011	E yi dɛntɛgɛn sa Alatala malekan xa naxan yi tixi miriti wudine tagi, e naxa, “Nxu bata bɔxɔn birin yisiga, bɔxɔn muxune birin sabatixi bɔɲɛ xunbenli.”
038	ZEC	001	012	Nayi, Alatalaa malekan yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna, i mi tinma kininkininɲɛ Yerusalɛn nun Yuda taane ma han waxatin mundun yi, i xɔlɔxi naxanye ma xabu ɲɛɛ tonge solofere?”
038	ZEC	001	013	Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, Alatala yi fala faɲine ti na xa, a yi a masabari.
038	ZEC	001	014	Malekan naxan yi falan tima n xa, na yi a fala n xa, a n xa falani ito rali: “Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘Xɔxɔlɔn gbeena n yi Yerusalɛn nun Siyon ma fe ra.
