041	MAR	016	015	A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ siga dunuɲa yiren birin yi, ɛ n ma falan Xibaru Faɲin kawandin ba daala birin xa.
041	MAR	016	016	Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya, a rafu igeni, na kisima nɛn. Xa naxan mi dɛnkɛlɛya, na yalagima nɛn.
041	MAR	016	017	Naxanye na dɛnkɛlɛya, e taxamasenni itoe ligama nɛn n xinli: E ɲinanne kedima nɛn, e yi xui gbɛtɛ nɛnɛne fala,
041	MAR	016	018	e yi saɲine suxu e yiine ra, e dabarin don, sese mi liga e ra. E yiin sama nɛn furetɔne ma, e yi e rakɛndɛya.”
