044	ACT	013	022	Ala Sɔli ba mangayani waxatin naxan yi, a yi Dawuda findi e mangan na. Ala a fala nɛn Dawuda fe yi, a naxa, ‘N bata a to, a muxun nan Yese a dii xɛmɛn Dawuda ra naxan bɔɲɛn luxi alo n bɔɲɛna.’”
