044	ACT	013	038	“Nanara, ngaxakedenne, nxu bata a rali ɛ ma, ɛ xa a kolon, a yulubine xafarima Yesu barakan nin. Musaa sariyan mi yi nɔɛ ɛ ratinxinɲɛ Ala yɛɛ ra yi yulubine fe ra,
