045	ROM	016	018	Amasɔtɔ na muxu sifane mi walima en Marigina Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xan xa mumɛ, koni e yɛtɛ rafan feene! E sɔntarene mayendenma e fala faɲine nun e wule matɔxɔ falane ra.
045	ROM	016	019	Muxun birin bata a mɛ a ɛ Alaa falan suxuma. Nayi, n sɛwaxi ɛ fe ra han, koni n wama nɛn ɛ xa findi xaxilimane ra ɛ fe faɲin kolon, ɛ yi fe ɲaxin matanga sɔntareyani.
