# BOOK	060	1PE	1 Peter	Piyɛri Singena
060	1PE	001	001	N tan Piyɛri, Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina xɛrana, n tan nan ito sɛbɛma Alaa muxu sugandixine ma, naxanye xuyaxi ayi xɔɲɛyani Pontu nun Galati nun Kapadose nun Asi nun Bitini yamanane yi.
060	1PE	001	002	Ɛ sugandixi nɛn alo Fafe Ala xaxinla yi a ma kii naxan yi nun. A bata ɛ rasariɲan a Nii Sariɲanxin barakani alogo ɛ xa xuru a Muxu Sugandixin Yesu ma, a wunla yi xuya ɛ ma ɛ rasariɲandeni. Ala xa hinanna nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi ɛ ma han!
060	1PE	001	003	En barikan bira Alaa Muxu Sugandixina en Marigi Yesu Fafe Ala xa. A bata a liga a kininkinin gbeeni, en yi xɛtɛ, en yi bari a nɛnɛn na, en so nii rakisin yigini Yesu a Muxu Sugandixin nakenla xɔn sayani.
060	1PE	001	004	Kɛɛn naxan mi kalama, a mi xɔrinxɔrinma, a mi lɔma ayi, na nan namaraxi ɛ xa ariyanna yi,
060	1PE	001	005	ɛ tan naxanye kantanxi a sɛnbɛni dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn alogo ɛ xa kisin sɔtɔ, naxan minima kɛnɛnni waxati raɲanne yi.
060	1PE	001	006	Na ma, ɛ sɛwa, hali ɛ to tɔrɔxi ɛ bunba feen sifan birin yi waxatidini ito yi
060	1PE	001	007	alogo ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyaan xa rasɛnsɛn. Hali xɛmaan naxan nɔɛ kalɛ, na raxulunma tɛɛn nan na, a rasɛnsɛn. Nayi, ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyaan naxan tɔnɔn gbo xɛmaan xa, na fan lan a rasɛnsɛn bunbaan xɔn, ɛ yi tantunna nun binyen nun xunna kenla sɔtɔ Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin mini waxatini kɛnɛnni.
060	1PE	001	008	Ɛ munma Marigin to singen koni ɛ a xanuxi. Ɛ mi a toma iki, koni ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyaxi a ma, ɛ lu sɛwa gbeeni naxan mi nɔɛ yɛbɛ.
060	1PE	001	009	Amasɔtɔ ɛ ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyaan xunna sɔtɔma nɛn, naxan findixi ɛ niin kisi feen na.
060	1PE	001	010	Nabiin naxanye hinanna fe fala, naxan yi ragidixi ɛ ma, naxan findixi kisi feen na, na findi nɛn ne fe yɛ fenna nun fe fɛsɛfɛsɛ xunna ra.
060	1PE	001	011	E yi katama waxatine nun taxamasenne kolon feen na Yesu a Nii Sariɲanxin yi naxanye makɛnɛnma e xa, a to yi e yi, a yi Alaa Muxu Sugandixina tɔrɔn nun a binye famatɔna fe fala benun a waxatin xa a li.
060	1PE	001	012	Ala a makɛnɛn nɛn nabine xa, a e mi yi walima e yɛtɛ xa koni ɛ tan, e to yi feene falama ɛ naxanye fe mɛxi na muxune ra naxanye Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nali ɛ ma Nii Sariɲanxin barakani naxan kelixi ariyanna yi. Hali malekane fan kunfaxi na feen fɛsɛfɛsɛ feni.
060	1PE	001	013	Nanara, ɛ xaxinli tɔn wanla fe ra, ɛ yɛtɛ suxu, ɛ yi ɛ yigi sa na hinanni ɛ naxan sɔtɔma Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin mini lɔxɔni kɛnɛnni.
060	1PE	001	014	Ɛ lu alo Alaa dii xuruxine, ɛ nama tin luyɛ ɛ kunfa ɲaxine yi, ɛ yi naxanye yi nun ɛ to yi xaxilitareyani.
060	1PE	001	015	Koni Ala sariɲanxi to ɛ xilixi, ɛ fan xa sariɲan ɛ kɛwanle birin yi alo a tan.
060	1PE	001	016	Amasɔtɔ a sɛbɛxi, “Ɛ xa sariɲan, amasɔtɔ n tan sariɲan.”
060	1PE	001	017	Ɛ to ɛ Fafe Ala maxandima, naxan muxune birin kɛwanle makitima kii kedenni, ɛ lu alo xɔɲɛne dunuɲani ito yi waxatidi, ɛ gaxu Ala yɛɛ ra.
060	1PE	001	018	Ɛ a kolon a ɛ mi xunbaxi ɛ fafane namun fe fuune ma se kala daxine xan na alo gbetina hanma xɛmana,
060	1PE	001	019	koni ɛ xunbaxi Alaa Muxu Sugandixin wuli fisamantenna nan xɔn, naxan baxi saraxan na alo yɛxɛɛ diina, fɛ mi naxan na.
060	1PE	001	020	Ala bata yi na sugandi benun dunuɲa xa da, a yi a ramini kɛnɛnni ɛ tan ma fe ra waxati dɔnxɛni itoe yi.
060	1PE	001	021	Ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyaxi Ala ma a tan nan baraka yi, Ala naxan a rakelixi sayani, a binyen fi na ma, alogo ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyaan nun yigin xa lu Ala yi.
060	1PE	001	022	Bayo ɛ bata ɛ yɛtɛ niin nasariɲan ɲɔndi suxun xɔn ma, ɛ yi xanuntenya kɛndɛn sɔtɔ ɛ ngaxakedenne xa, nayi, ɛ bode xanu ɛ sɛnbɛn birin na sariɲanni.
060	1PE	001	023	Amasɔtɔ ɛ bata xɛtɛ, ɛ mɔn yi bari a nɛnɛn na, naxan mi fata adamadiin na naxan faxama, koni fata Alaa falan na naxan niima, a luma habadan.
060	1PE	001	024	Bayo a sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, a naxa, “Adamadiine birin luxi nɛn alo sɛxɛna, e binyen birin yi lu alo se fugena. Sɛxɛne xarama nɛn, e fugene yi yolon.
060	1PE	001	025	Koni Marigina falan luma nɛn habadan.” Na falan findixi Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nan na naxan nalixi ɛ ma.
060	1PE	002	001	Na ma, ɛ ba fe ɲaxin sifan birin ma e nun yanfantenyaan nun nafigiyaan nun milɛn nun fala ɲaxin birin.
060	1PE	002	002	Niin balo kɛndɛn xɔnla xa ɛ suxu alo xiɲɛ xɔnla dii futen suxuma kii naxan yi, alogo ɛ fan xa sabati ɛ kisi feni a xɔn,
060	1PE	002	003	ɛ to bata a mato, ɛ yi a kolon a Marigin fan.
060	1PE	002	004	Ɛ maso a ra, naxan findixi siimaya gɛmɛn na, adamadiine e mɛxi naxan na, koni Ala naxan sugandixi, a mɔn yi a xunna keli.
060	1PE	002	005	Ɛ tan fan bata findi Alaa banxin ti seene ra alo gɛmɛ niiramane, ɛ yi findi saraxarali yama sariɲanxin na, ɛ yi siimaya saraxane ba Ala tinxi naxanye ra fata a Muxu Sugandixin Yesu ra.
060	1PE	002	006	Amasɔtɔ Kitabuni ito nan falaxi, a naxa, “N bata gɛmɛna nde dɔxɔ Siyon taani alo banxin tongon gɛmɛ faɲi yɛbaxina. Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, yagin mi na kanna liyɛ.”
060	1PE	002	007	Gɛmɛni ito xunna kenla ɛ tan dɛnkɛlɛya muxune nan xa, koni Kitabun yireni ito nan lanxi dɛnkɛlɛyatarene tan ma, a naxa, “Banxi tiine e mɛ gɛmɛn naxan na, na bata findi banxi gɛmɛ fisamantenna ra.”
060	1PE	002	008	A mɔn sɛbɛxi Kitabun kui, a naxa, “Yamana e sanna radinma gɛmɛn naxan na, a findi e rabira gɛmɛn na.” E e dinma a ra nɛn amasɔtɔ e mi tinxi falan suxɛ, anu na nan yi ragidixi e ma.
060	1PE	002	009	Koni ɛ tan bata findi yama sugandixin na. Mangane nun saraxaraline nan ɛ tan na, siya sariɲanxina, Ala gbeen yamaan naxan na, alogo ɛ xa a wali faɲi gbeene fe rali, a tan naxan ɛ xilixi, a yi ɛ ba dimini, siga a kabanako kɛnɛnyani.
060	1PE	002	010	A fɔlɔni, Alaa yama mi yi ɛ ra nun koni iki, ɛ bata findi a yamaan na. Ɛ tan naxan mi yi Alaa kininkininna sɔtɔxi, koni iki, ɛ bata a kininkininna sɔtɔ.
060	1PE	002	011	Nba, ngaxakedenne, ɛ tan naxanye luxi alo xɔɲɛne nun sigatine dunuɲa yi, n na ɛ mafanma, ɛ yɛtɛ suxu fati bɛndɛn kunfa feene ma naxanye ɛ niin yɛngɛma.
060	1PE	002	012	Ɛ kɛwanle xa fanɲɛ ayi nɛn dɛnkɛlɛyatarene yɛ, alogo, e na ɛ mafala fe ɲaxi rabaan na, e xa ɛ kɛwali faɲine to, e yi Ala binya a fa lɔxɔni.
060	1PE	002	013	Ɛ xuru adamadiyaan mangayane birin bun Marigina fe ra, a na findi manga gbeen na
060	1PE	002	014	hanma yamana kanne, a naxanye rasigaxi wali kobine sarandeni fe ɲaxi rabane ra, e yi fe faɲi rabane tantun e wali faɲine ra.
060	1PE	002	015	Amasɔtɔ Ala sagoon na a ra, a ɛ fe faɲi rabaan xa xaxilitarene radundun e xaxilitareyani.
060	1PE	002	016	Ɛ findi muxu xɔrɔyaxine ra, koni ɛ nama ɛ xɔrɔyaan findi fe ɲaxin luxun seen na, ɛ findi Alaa konyi faɲine ra.
060	1PE	002	017	Ɛ muxun birin binya, ɛ yi ɛ dɛnkɛlɛya muxun bonne xanu, ɛ yi gaxu Ala yɛɛ ra, ɛ yamana kanna binya.
060	1PE	002	018	Walikɛne, ɛ xuru ɛ kuntigine ma, ɛ yi kuntigi ɲaxine binya feen birin yi alo a faɲine nun a diɲaxine.
060	1PE	002	019	Amasɔtɔ, na findixi fe faɲin nan na, xa muxun limaniya ɲaxankatan bun ma Ala kolonna fe ra, a a li na ɲaxankatan mi lanxi a kɛwanle ma.
060	1PE	002	020	Koni na findɛ binyen na ɛ xa di, xa ɛ ɲaxankata ɛ kala tixine fe ra, ɛ yi limaniya? Anu, xa ɛ tɔrɔ ɛ kɛwali faɲine fe ra, ɛ yi limaniya, fe faɲin nan na ra Ala yɛɛ ra yi.
060	1PE	002	021	Ala ɛ xilixi na nan ma, bayo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin yɛtɛɛn tɔrɔ nɛn ɛ xa, a yi misaala lu ɛ yii alogo ɛ xa bira a fɔxɔ ra.
060	1PE	002	022	Kitabun naxa, “A mi yulubi yo liga, a mi yanfa fala yo ti.”
