060	1PE	005	005	Banxulanne, ɛ fan xa xuru fonne ma. Ɛ birin xa yɛtɛ magodon lu ɛ ma alo dugina ɛ nɛma ɛ bode xɔn ma. Amasɔtɔ Kitabun naxa, “Ala wasodene yikalama e feene yi, koni a hinanma nɛn yɛtɛ magodone ra.”
060	1PE	005	006	Ɛ ɛ magodo Ala sɛnbɛn bun, alogo a xa ɛ yite a waxɔn waxatini.
060	1PE	005	007	Ɛ ɛ xaminna feene birin lu a ma, amasɔtɔ a yengi ɛ xɔn.
